From 93b376834729774fef85491723ca766058cd7c55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 03:25:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 203/488] soh: rename D_80A7DEB0 -> sSoilHomingProgress

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: f32 ramped by 1/300 per frame and clamped at 1.0, reset to 0 when a bug finds nearby soil; it shrinks the random wander radius around the soil actor until the bug heads straight for it.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Insect/z_en_insect.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../actors/ovl_En_Insect/z_en_insect.c        | 27 ++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Insect/z_en_insect.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Insect/z_en_insect.c
index 7086acccd..aa51fd860 100644
